From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Can Us <me@canus.dev>
Date: Wed, 23 Sep 2026 22:19:22 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] libwebp: build the decoder for WASM without the webp.js
 demo

The tnt wrapper forces WEBP_BUILD_WEBP_JS ON for WASM, and webp.js needs
SDL2 (find_package REQUIRED), so a WASM configure with
FILAMENT_SUPPORTS_WEBP_TEXTURES=ON fails. Filament only links the
webpdecoder library. Needed for the WebAssembly build of glTF assets
that use EXT_texture_webp.

diff --git a/third_party/libwebp/tnt/CMakeLists.txt b/third_party/libwebp/tnt/CMakeLists.txt
index 15cc91cf..a99f641b 100644
--- a/third_party/libwebp/tnt/CMakeLists.txt
+++ b/third_party/libwebp/tnt/CMakeLists.txt
@@ -16,7 +16,11 @@ set(WEBP_BUILD_EXTRAS OFF)
 set(WEBP_BUILD_FUZZTEST OFF)
 
 if (WASM)
-    set(WEBP_BUILD_WEBP_JS ON)
+    # Lumina local patch: webp.js is a demo viewer
+    # that needs SDL2; Filament only links the webpdecoder library, and with
+    # webp.js ON a WASM configure with FILAMENT_SUPPORTS_WEBP_TEXTURES fails
+    # on find_package(SDL2).
+    set(WEBP_BUILD_WEBP_JS OFF)
     set(WEBP_ENABLE_SIMD OFF)
     # ensure non-empty config var value
     if (WASM_PTHREADS)
